[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イルメリア先輩！\u3000後ろ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miss Ilmeria! Behind you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かってるわ！\nこれくらい……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know! This is nothing...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どんなもんよ！\n天才の手にかかれば余裕ね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How do you like that?! A genius like me can handle this with ease!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おぉ……！\n一撃で倒しちゃった……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa...! You took it down in one hit...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんな雑魚同然の魔物なんて\n目を瞑ってでも倒せるわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I could defeat weaklings like that with my eyes closed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんて言ったって、天才だからね！\nアタシに全部任せなさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After all, I'm a genius! Just leave it all to me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イルちゃん、もしかして前よりも強くなってない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria, haven't you gotten stronger than before?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "当然よ！\u3000ソフィーさんにも負けないくらい\nアタシも錬金術の腕を磨いているんだから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course! I've been honing my alchemy skills so I won't lose to you either, Sophie!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "天才ならここにもいるんだけど？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's another genius right here too, you know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれっ！？\u3000いつの間にあんな数の魔物を！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa! When did so many monsters show up?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "相変わらず強いわね、ヨハナ。\n速さも今と前じゃ段違いじゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're as strong as ever, Johanna. Your speed is on a whole different level from before."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "当たり前よ。\n私は天才なんだから、日々強くなるの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Obviously. It's natural for a genius like me to get stronger with every passing day."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふん！\u3000アタシこそが真の天才よ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph! I'm the true genius here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんな雑魚１匹倒しただけで天才なんて。\nふふ、笑っちゃうわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Boasting that you're a genius after defeating only one measly monster? Ha, what a joke!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、なんですって！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what did you say?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナ、成長したなぁって思ってたけど\nこういうところは昔のまんまだね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was thinking Johanna had grown up, but she's still has a long way to go in some respects..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "張り合ってるところ悪いんだけど\n今がどこらへんなのか教えてくれない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry to interrupt your rivalry, but could you tell us where we are right now?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そろそろ狼の魔物の縄張りのはずよ。\nみんな、警戒して――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We should be getting close to the wolf monsters' territory. Everyone, stay alert—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "って言ってるそばから出てきた！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And here they come, right on cue!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナ、本の中に対策とか書いてない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna, does the book say anything about how to deal with them?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなの確認してる暇ないわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't have time to check that right now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "貸して。私たちが確認するわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let me see it. We'll check for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なになに……\n『姫を救けに来た騎士が名乗りを上げる』？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's see... 'The knight who came to rescue the princess announces himself'?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やっぱり誰かがその役目になるってことかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So someone needs to take on that role, I guess?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "「それなら天才のこの私が！」\n「それなら天才のこのアタシが！」",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\"Then this genius will do it!\" \"Then this genius will do it!\""
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ふたり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Both"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "削除",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "削除",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それなら私が騎士を名乗らせてもらおう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Allow me to take on the role of knight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ステルクさん！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]